<title>UK: Physical Brent trades Dec -35 cts for one mln bbls.</title>
<headline>Physical Brent trades Dec -35 cts for one mln bbls.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physical Brent traded at December Brent -35 cents for a million barrel cargo loading Dec 1-3, traders said.</p>
<p>This followed an earlier trade of a normal sized cargo of 500,000 barrels at Dec -48 cents for a Dec 28-30 loader.</p>
<p>The fate of Tuesday's two Brent dates which turned wet at five o'clock was not known, but one was believed to have been clocked.</p>
<p>-- Kate Dourian +44 171 542 4088</p>
